  questions:
  - questionText: Ah Youre Finally awake. this place isn't safe, you know. if you
      want to survive, you'll have to learn how to take care of your self
    replies:
    - Where am i
    correctReplyIndex: 0
  - questionText: Somewhere far from the safety you're used to. Don't worry. I'll
      teach you what you need to know. After that, you'll have to survive on your
      own
    replies:
    - '!'
    correctReplyIndex: 0
  - questionText: First learn the movement controls so you can navigate the world
    replies:
    - Okay
    correctReplyIndex: 0
  - questionText: Use WASD to move your character and click the mouse to attack enemies
    replies:
    - Okay got it
    correctReplyIndex: 0
  - questionText: Collect meat and coins from your surrounding. you can use them
      to buy items from the shop
    replies:
    - Alright
    correctReplyIndex: 0
  - questionText: Beware of enemies they can attack you, so be ready to fight
    replies:
    - Okay thanks!
    correctReplyIndex: 0
  - questionText: You've proven yourself ready for the next stage. keep going and
